-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=927017#post927017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The original Bardo (now Witch Doctor) was indeed quite different looking. I sneaked a reference to Phoenix in the History section, in case crossover hapens)</div> </div> </div> </div>I see. I actually changed Phoenix's hometown to Louisville, Kentucky. But, I'll change it to Boston just for crossover possibilities. Plus, it's a mage city, so it fits well with his backstory and gives him a reason to go there in any future chronicles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T23:41:03-07:00","id":927467,"title":"","content":"Note that maybe none of them were mages at the time they met this time around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T21:19:03-07:00","id":930159,"title":"","content":"Thank you all for your patience on this! I've been prioritizing getting the first game up and running. I'm back from vacation now, which ironically means I'm more likely to have time to speed this up and play more regularly. <br /> <br /> I will try to add some additional setting info and speak more about the Denver area for this chronicle in the next day or two. If you haven't already, please try to put stats to your character and post here using the format I provided (courtesy of the other play group).<br /> <br /> Let me know if anyone has any questions!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T22:00:48-07:00","id":930172,"title":"","content":"Not questions per se, but I'm still mulling over my initial Arcana spread and whether to have an small clinic or work in one of the three hospitals in Denver.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T12:21:22-07:00","id":930466,"title":"","content":"Al set and ready to talk character stuff in case I missed anything. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Hope you had a good holiday!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T12:54:33-07:00","id":930988,"title":"","content":"I've been working through some ideas for the plot for the first story of this chronicle, and I wanted to suggest a slight tweak. How do you feel about setting it several weeks after you Awakened? You would all be fledgling mages, but we would skip past the part of you learning about each other and Awakened society, getting initiated into an Order (for those who choose to), and learning more of the basics about the Veil and spellcasting. The game would begin just after you officially form the cabal.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, you would use all of the standard character creation rules, but you would have full access to your Order-based bonuses (High Speech, rotes, Order status, extra Occult, etc.) immediately upon starting the game.<br /> <br /> Does that work?<br /> <br /> Also, paging <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12044-chaosarchon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12044_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12044\" data-vbnamecard=\"12044\">ChaosArchon</a> - Haven't seen you post in the thread here yet. Are you still interested in this Mage game?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /