tle":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T12:35:48-07:00","id":939042,"title":"","content":"Alright, IC thread is finally up! <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a>, please finalize your nimbus and feel free to discuss your familiar here when you have a chance. You can still get your first posts in whenever you have a chance, the other stuff can be taken care of later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T13:11:18-07:00","id":939068,"title":"","content":"Quick question. How do we handle dice rolling here?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T13:18:56-07:00","id":939075,"title":"","content":"You come up with good questions Retias.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T13:31:57-07:00","id":939086,"title":"","content":"Wow you are a good writer Rwknoll","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T14:45:00-07:00","id":939151,"title":"","content":"In the other game they are using a webpage where you can link the rolls for all to see and add descriptions. Is pretty neat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T16:50:12-07:00","id":939217,"title":"","content":"Yes, great points I forgot to make. <br /> <br /> When you make your posts, please include in the header info about your active Mage Sight, spells (including potency and duration), conditions/tilts, health, and mana/Willpower. For an example, I'm looking for something <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=938448#post938448\">like this</a>. You might also want to use alternate color for your character's text (like speech) so it sticks out when viewing. <br /> <br /> For out of character (OOC) info, please put that in your post using the spoiler tag ([spoiler]).<br /> <br /> For dice rolls, please use any website that keeps permanent links to your rolls so I can see the results. I prefer <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/?action=roll\" target=\"_blank\">Orokos</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T23:05:20-07:00","id":939370,"title":"","content":"Let's see then. I want to have cloaked myself in Wards and Signs.<br /> <br /> My Gnosis is 1 and my Prime is 2, so that's 3 to start with. My dedicated tool gets me +1 which is 4. and will use high speech which is +2 for my second yantra. Willpower as well for bringing 9 dice total, and one ritual interval for a final +1. Spending my free reach to make it an advanced duration. Primary factor is Duration, so it'll last for a week with my +1 to the chart. And I'll raie potency two steps to 3, for 4. So, six dice.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422976\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422976\" target=\"_blank\"> Dice Roller &bull; Orokos.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422976\" target=\"_blank\"> http://orokos.com/roll/422976 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Orokos is a tool site for role-playing games, such as Dungeons and Dragons 4th edition, allowing players to upload characters from Wizards of the Coast's Character Builder program and providing a dice roller and attribute calculator. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well, not a great start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T02:20:10-07:00","id":939409,"title":"","content":"Ok, let's try this dice roller thingy and the new magic system. Doc Bates will had cast Supress Aura (Death 2) on himself. 1 free Reach to use Advanced Duration. Ritual casting time. Yantras: Mantras (+2), Sacrament (ashes of a cremated body +1).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422993\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422993\" target=\"_blank\"> Dice Roller &bull; Orokos.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422993\" target=\"_blank\"> http://orokos.com/roll/422993 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Orokos is a tool site for role-playing games, such as Dungeons and Dragons 4th edition, allowing players to upload characters from Wizards of the Coast's Character Builder program and providing a dice roller and attribute calculator. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200b2 Successes. Aura Supressed for a Day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T05:54:02-07:00","id":939474,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2650\" data-vbnamecard=\"2650\">Retias</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar195_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"195\" data-vbnamecard=\"195\">Thorbes</a> - Am I correct in assuming that you would have cast these spells prior to the current scene? Because ritual casting time for you both is 3 hours. And even though neither of your spells would be obvious displays of magic, casting in public can always risk drawing supernatural attention.<br /> <br /> Retias, I think you also accidentally copied over incorrect info from Phoenix in the header for Spider. You currently have it listed as 8 health, including 1 resistant bashing damage. You should be at 7 health with no damage.<br /> <br /> Also, can you please make sure to include all character actions and spells in your posts on the IC thread? Please use the spoiler BBcode tag, like this for example:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Casting <i>The Outward and Inward Eye</i> (Space 1)<br /> 2 Free Reach; Spending for instant speed, 1 beyond spell control, and 2 for the option to see through spatial warps.<br /> Attempting to contain: Paradox 2 + 4 (prior risk) - 2 (dedicated tool) - 2 (spending 2 Mana) = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421447\" target=\"_blank\">1 success </a><br /> Wisdom 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/421448\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes!</a> +1 Resistant Bashing!<br /> <br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Space 2 + Yantra 2 (Concentration) = 5 -&gt; <a href=\"http://http//orokos.com/roll/421450\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> For everyone: I'd like to use the dice rolling convention that was agreed upon in the other thread. You're welcome to make rolls before I tell you penalties, etc. as a means to save time in a play-by-post game, but in some cases I may need to edit your rolls. If you would have a bonus for some reason that wasn't included in the initial roll, I'll roll the extra dice and add any successes to your roll. If there was a penalty, I'll take off dice from the roll in reverse order.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-29-2016, 08:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T06:59:14-07:00","id":939498,"title":"","content":"Yes, the idea is that it was cast before the scene, as a kind of morning ritual. I'll edit the action in spoilers in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divide