to diagnose or assess her condition, not treat her. Sorry for not clarifying. You can cast the spell and still try the Wits+Medicine roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T11:18:01-07:00","id":953304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tambov</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=953266#post953266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">BTW, what car's stats does an ATV use? I currently assume Pick-Up.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want to use something like the Jeep in that picture, I'd say pick-up truck is probably your closest bet. But when you say ATV, I normally think of a smaller vehicle like a quad -- are you trying to find stats for the vehicle in the picture, or a true ATV?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T11:38:23-07:00","id":953325,"title":"","content":"In my post the first two rolls were a mistake. I can only use 9 again on non spell casting rolls. The third roll is OK","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T11:58:16-07:00","id":953335,"title":"","content":"I need to add advanced duration reach to put her in stasis for an hour, more than enough time for Ouroboros to stabilize her. I cast veil with 3 reaches, 2 over my limit. I spend 4 mana to mitigate paradox. I take 2 turns to spend the mana.<br /> 1 Reach instant spell casting<br /> 1 reach naturally heal<br /> Everything else should be fine. Duration is the primary spell factor for this spell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-18-2016, 03:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T13:19:41-07:00","id":953379,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7592\" data-vbnamecard=\"7592\">wtaylorjr2001</a> - Thanks for clarifying. I was about to say that you need to roll Paradox for overreaching, but you already commented on that here. I want to point out that technically, you still roll Paradox even if you mitigate the number of dice using mana; if you bring it to 0 dice, you roll a chance die. A dramatic failure on the paradox roll is actually a good thing in this case (i.e., the paradox itself dramatically fails at interfering with your spell casting).<br /> <br /> Can I ask everyone to use a more structured format for spell casting rolls/info in your posts? My other game has been running for a few more weeks than this one, so we've already had the chance to smooth out a couple of things related to casting and posting info about spells in a PBP game. Here is an example of a format that really helps me follow your info:<br /> <br /> Casting <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia?p=952503#post952503\"><i>Mind over Matter</i></a> (Mind 2)<br /> Mana: Spending 3; 1 for Reach option, 2 for paradox mitigation<br /> Reach: 2 Free; Spending for instant speed, advanced duration, and option to stay conscious.<br /> Paradox (containing): 1 + 4 (prior risk) - 2 (tool) - 2 (mana) vs Wisdom 7 = 1 vs 7 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427865\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> vs <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427866\" target=\"_blank\">1</a><br /> Yantras: Knife (reflexive, dedicated)<br /> Factors: Potency 3, Duration Scene<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 1 + Mind 3 - 2 (wound penalties) = 2 -&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427864\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a><br /> <br /> So, using this format for the spell you just cast, it'd look like this:<br /> <br /> <b>Veil of Moments </b>(Time 2, Shielding Practice)<br /> Mana: Spending 4 for paradox mitigation (spent over 2 turns)<br /> Reach: 1 free; spending 3 for instant speed, advanced duration, and allow natural healing<br /> Paradox (containing): 4 (gnosis) - 4 (mana) vs. Wisdom 7 = 0 vs. 7 --&gt; [insert Paradox chance die roll] vs. [insert Wisdom roll]<br /> Yantras: High speech, Dedicated tool<br /> Factors: Potency 1, Duration 1 day<br /> Spellcasting: Gnosis 3 + Time 2 + High Speech 2 + Dedicated Tool 1 + Willpower 3 = 11 --&gt; <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427917\" target=\"_blank\">7 successes</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 08-18-2016, 04:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","va